          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ડુબાડવું — ḍubāḍvũ — \"to submerge; to flood\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "નદીએ આખું ગામ ડુબાડી દીધું. nadīe ākhũ gām ḍubāḍī dīdhũ. The river flooded the whole village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે હોડી ડુબાડી, teṇe hoḍī ḍubāḍī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ડુબાડવું (ḍubāḍvũ) is the causative of ડૂબવું, to sink, from ḍubb, \"sink\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 5561): to make something go under. The long ū of ડૂબવું shortens in the longer verb."
            }
          ]
        },
